   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Accept_%28Chicken_Shack_album%29",
   "resumo_en": "Accept is the fourth studio album by the blues band, Chicken Shack, released in 1970.  Accept was Chicken Shack's last album on the Blue Horizon label.  This album was also the last for Andy Sylvester, Dave Bidwell and Paul Raymond as members of Chicken Shack. It also marks a departure from pure blues to a more progressive and psychedelic sound.\nThe entire album and the rest of the Chicken Shack sessions on Blue Horizon were made available on the CD compilation Chicken Shack – The Complete Blue Horizon Sessions (2007).\nThe German heavy metal band Accept took its name from this album.",
